<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 Peter</book>
  <para style="h">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Peter</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Simon Peter, Jesu Khrist suoh leh sawltah in, Pasian leh i hundampa Jesu Khrist dihtatna zal a ginna manpha itan bang tangte kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian leh i Mangpa Jesu theina ziehin, noute kungah hepina leh lungmuonna suhpungin umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama thupina leh hoina a eite hing hanpa theina ziehin Pasian silbawltheina bangin hinna leh Pasian ngaisahna lam thu ah sil zousie ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate ziehin thuchiem manpha leh thupi mama khu ahing pie a, tuachia tahsa utna zieh a leitung sietna a pat a suohta a Pasian hinna kitanpite na hing hi theita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehmain thanopsuo unlen, na ginna uah hoina belap unlen, na hoina uah theina belap unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na theina uah kidehtheina belap unlen, na kidehtheina uah kukalna belap unlen, na kukalna uah Pasian ngaisahna belap un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na Pasian ngaisahna uah unau kideisahna belap unlen, unau kideisahna ah, itna belap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen tam silte nouma a um ahia, kichingtah a na nei u’leh, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist theina lamah chiing leh ga neilou in na um sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam silte tasam mi pouma nainou khat mu a, mitto ahia, akhelna luite akipat siensah ahita chi manghil mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute, noute hat na hina u’leh tel na hina uh kichiensah dingin thanop suo zaw sem un, tamte na bawl u’leh na kipalpua ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n i Mangpa leh hundampa Jesu Khrist kumtawn leenggam a lutna noute kungah ahing musah nasa mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam silte theiin, thutah na kung ua uma na kipna uah tua silte khu hing theipi ngitnget dingin, ngaisah louin ka um mawngmawng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, tam ka tahsa puon inn a ka um sungin noute hing theithasah zelin, hing tohhal hoi kasa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist hing theisah mabangin, tam ka tahsa puon inn ka koimang paita ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ka peikhieh nua chienga tam silte na thei tha zelzel theina dingun ka hakat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist silbawltheina leh ahing peikiana ding thu ka hing theisah lai un, pillepchie tah a phuothu tangthu pou zuite ka hi sih ua, Ama vangletna mute ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama’n Pa Pasian kunga kipata pahtawina leh thupina amu laitahin, Avanglien thupi mama akipat tambangin aw khat ka kungah ahing tunga, “Tami Ka Tapa deitah ahi, atung ah ka lungdam mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh taang siengthoua akunga ka um lai un, tam aw khu van a kipata hing pawt koute mama in ka za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Genlawhna thu akip zaw sem i nei uhi, khuo ahing vah a, zingsol aasi na lungtang ua ahing suoh masangsie mun miel a um vah hing taang ding angaisah bang ua na ngaisah u’leh abawl hoi na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Laisiengthou thugen mawngmawng koiman ama deibanga aledoh ding ahi sih chi thei masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen thugenlawh mawngmawng nidang laiin mihing deidan a pawt ahi sih a, Pasian misiengthouten, Hagau Siengthou phuut ahi bangzel ua ana gen uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh mite lah ah guolnei tahloute zong ana um zel mabangin, na lah uah zong thuhilmi tahloute ahing um ding uhi, amauten, amauh leipa Mangpa nangawn kitheimawbawlin, mi suse thei giindan tuomte aguhin ahing polut ding ua amauh tungah thakhat in sietna atungsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tampiten agamtatna zumhuoite uh a zui ding ua, amaute ziehin thutah lampi gensiet in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh du amna ziehin zuou thuin neh sui na in noute ahing nei ding uhi, sawtpi lai a atung ua vaihawmna khu akhawl sih a, asiemloutanna u’zong a imu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vansawlsiengte nangawn akhel lai un, Pasian in akhawi sih a, gawtmun ah apai a, vaihawm pieh a um dingin kokhuh miel ah akhum zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aman nidanglai leitung ahinkhawi sih a, Pasian ngaisahlou leitungah tuichim atungsah a, hinanleh dihtatna thugenpa Noah midang sagi toh ahundamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomorrah khopite vutvai asuohsaha, mawtangsahin apaikhie a, Pasian ngaisahlou a hin tum mi hing um dingte etsahna dingin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh mi giloute umdan thanghuoitah zieha lungsim na mama midihtat Lot khu ahunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua miditatpa akung ua aten laiin, amit in amu a abil in aza a, danbeia agamtatnate un, midihtatpa hinna hagau nisimin asugenthei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa’n Ama ngaisah mite khu solna akipat hutkhiet dan leh midihtat loute khu vaihawmni a dinga gawt kawm a khawidan a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Adiehin utna thanghuoi lam a tahsa dan banga um leh, thuneina simmawte ngel hawi vaihawmni a ding a gawt kawma khawidan athei sem hi. Amaute pen mot hansan leh migenhate ahi ua, vantungmi thupite nangawn gensiet zaulou ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vansawlsieng hatna leh silbawltheina nei zawten bawn, Mangpa mai ah, amauh tungthu demin agenpieh ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh tam miten gamsa gilou ngaituona neilou mat a suhmang dingte bangin atheisiemlou uh silte agensie ua, tuachi’n amauh sietna ah amangthai sieng ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh suntang lai a zukham annkham nuomsate ahi ziehun dihtatlouna man amu ding uhi. Na kung ua ankuong alui lai un amauh kisolna ankuonglui ahi zieh un, thanghuoina gensietna ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aangkawmna mit a dim, khelna tawpsan theiloute anei ua, lungsim detloute asolpua ua, thangsiet lungsim apuo ua, hamse thuoh tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lampi dih ataisan ua, avahmang ua, dihtatlouna thaman ngainapa Beor tapa Balaam lampi azuita uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh ama pen agitlouna ziehin phawhhil in a um a; sabiltung ham theilou khu mihing hama hing hamin guolneipa motna khu akhaamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamte pen tui umlou tuikhuh leh meilum huipi semmang bang ahi uhi, amaute a dingin mielna nasatah kumtawna kheet ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen amauten bangma umlou thute uongsan tahin agen ua, tahsa utna thanghuoi, khelna akipata suohtate azawl zou zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaute mama gitlouna sala tang pum in mite kungah zalenna thu achiem leng uhi, tua mi athuzawna thu mamain ama khu sila in akailut zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa leh hundampa Jesu Khrist theina zieha leitung thanghuoinate anuasiasan nua ua tuate mama a ataankia ua, zaw a aum u’leh aumdan nukhia pen u’khu achiil a sangin ase zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen dihtatna lampi theinua a thupieh siengthou amau kunga kipesawn kinuaheisan sangin dihtatna lampi theilou ana hi vanglah u’leh ama ua dingin ahoizaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ui ama luoh lang ah akia kia a, vohpi kisilsiengsa abuol a buonnawi ah akibuol kia hi kichi, paunah khu amaute tungah ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />It tahte aw, tua na kung ua ka gel laihah anina ahi, tuategel ah na lungsim chiimtahte uh tohthouna dinga ka hing theisah kiana ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Guolnei siengthoute’n ana gen masah uh thute leh, Kou Mangpa leh hundampa sawltahte thupieh na thei ngitnget na ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami thei masa un, Ni nukhia lam ah, simmawhatte amauh tahsa utna bangbang a gamta ahing um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauten “A hing peikia na ding thuchiem heiah a um ei? I pu ipate lah ashita ua, tuami nualang kalsie siemchiil a kipat sil bangkim angai ngai in a umtou zel nalai hi,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen tam silte haw akitheimawbawl zel ua, nidang lai in vante Pasian thuin ahing uma leitung zong tui lah apat akilangdoh a, tui ah zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hun lai a leitung um khu tuichim in ana tum a, abeimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh tua um vante leh leitung khu Pasian thu main, Pasian ngaisahlou mite vaihawmna leh manthaina ni a mei a suhsiet dinga kholkhawm ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Ka ittahte aw, tam sil khat manghil sih un, Mangpa adingin ni khat khu kum tul khat bang ahi a, kum tul khat zong ni khat bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in zekai asah bangun, Mangpa khu athuchiem ah azekai sih hi, koima manthai ding deilouin, mi zousie kisia ding adei ziehin eima lam a dawzou ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa ni khu zan a guta banga hing tung ding ahi, tua ni chiengin, vante khu nasatah a gingin amang dinga, tualeh vanlam silte mei a haltui ahi ding a, leitung zong asunga nasep umte zousie toh haltum in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tam silte zousie tuabanga zunmang sieng ding ahi chi theiin umdan siengthou leh Pasian ngaisahna lam phot ah mi bangchi bang ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasian ni hing tung ding kinem leh kilawp kawmin ngah un, tua niin vante khu hing katum in amang ding hi, van a sil um zousiete mei a haltui in aumta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahivangin athuchiem dungzuiin asunga dihtatna umna van tha leh lei tha ikineppi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin ittahte aw, tam silte kineppi na hi uh chi theiin, nieh banglou leh gensietbei leh lungmuongtah a uma mu nahi theina dingun, thanopsuoin pang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh i Mangpa thuohzouna khu hundamnain na tuot un, i unau ittah Paul in akunga kipie pilna dungzuia na kung ua agel bang in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Alaihah zousie ah tam silte agiel hi, tua alaihahte ah sil theisiem hasa pawlkhat aum a, tuate pen mipillou leh midetlouten Laisiengthou dang ama uh deibanga akaikawi bang ua kaikawi in amauh sietna dingin azang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin ittahte aw, nouten tua thute na thei masah ziehun pilvangun, tuachilouin vang migiloute khelna a puimanga umin na dinmundet ua kipat in na pua kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh i Mangpa leh hundampa Jesu Khrist hepina leh theina ah hing khanglien un, Ama kungah tu leh kumtawn in thupina umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
